    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents are delighted to bring 6 River walk to the sales market. This modern built 3 bedroomed mid-terrace property with an energy rating `A` is located just off the Malahide Road. The property is presented in turnkey condition offering modern living, high quality finishes and spacious light filled accommodation for those seeking a stylish and comfortable home. The accommodation comprises of a bright and spacious reception hall with downstairs wc, large open plan lounge/dining/kitchen with French doors leading to a low maintenance rear garden. Upstairs comprises of 3 bedrooms (master ensuite) and family bathroom. The property will suit first time buyers, people looking to trade up in the area or investors. Viewing strongly recommended to appreciate all that this fine family home has to offer.\n\nSituated in a very convenient location with a choice of bus links and a 20 minute walk to nearby DART station. There are a choice of shopping centres at Clarehall and Donaghmede, coffee shops, restaurants, selection of sports clubs all within walking distance, Father Collins Park is a 15 minute walk and Portmarnock beach is a 15 minute drive from the property. There is a choice of bus routes serving the city centre, and property is within close proximity of the M50/M1 motorways and Dublin International Airport."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch Entrance\n\nReception Hall\nUnderstairs storage. Laminate flooring.\n\nDownstairs wc & whb\nUnder sink storage. Timber wall panelling. Tiled floor. Heated towel rail.\n\nLounge - 4.02m (13'2\") x 3.8m (12'6\")\nBay window. Laminate flooring.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.78m (19'0\") x 3.14m (10'4\")\nRange of fitted press units. Plumbed for dishwasher. Breakfast bar. Laminate flooring. PVC French doors to rear.\n\nUtility Room - 1.92m (6'4\") x 1.58m (5'2\")\nFitted presses. Plumbed for washing machine. Tiled floor.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.01m (13'2\") x 3.38m (11'1\")\nBuilt in wardrobes. Laminate flooring. Ensuite comprising: Shower, screen, whb and wc. Partially tiled walls. Tiled floor. Heated towel rail.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.45m (11'4\") x 3.38m (11'1\")\nBuilt in wardrobes. Laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.93m (9'7\") x 2.34m (7'8\")\nBuilt in wardrobe. Laminate flooring.\n\nBathroom\nBath, separate shower tray, screen, whb and wc. Partially tiled walls. Tiled floor.\n\n"
      },
